bash: /usr/bin/labmotd: Permission denied

$ which labmotd
/usr/bin/which: no labmotd in (/home/lab/.local/bin:/home/lab/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin)

$ rpm -qf /usr/bin/labmotd
labmotd-1.0-1.noarch


========== 演習11 の解答: --setperms は権限だけを戻し、--replacepkgs で入れ直すと全部戻る ==========

$ rpm -V labmotd; echo $?
.M.......    /usr/bin/labmotd
S.5....T.    /usr/share/labmotd/motd.txt
1

$ sudo rpm --setperms labmotd

$ rpm -V labmotd; echo $?
S.5....T.    /usr/share/labmotd/motd.txt
1

$ sudo rpm -Uvh --replacepkgs /srv/lab-rpm/labmotd-1.0-1.noarch.rpm
Verifying...                          ################################# [100%]
Preparing...                          ################################# [100%]
Updating / installing...
   1:labmotd-1.0-1                    ################################# [ 50%]
Cleaning up / removing...
   2:labmotd-1.0-1                    ################################# [100%]

$ rpm -V labmotd; echo $?
0


