========== 演習12 の解答: yumdownloader の --destdir と --resolve ==========

$ yumdownloader --destdir /tmp/dl labtool
Last metadata expiration check: 2:10:07 ago on Tue Oct 20 19:34:06 2026.

$ ls /tmp/dl
